		(uuid "45f3e958-5fac-4152-85cd-bff825221118")
	)
	(text "CMD_N15 drives the LED of U1101 through R1101 (330 Ohm). The optocoupler\nlevel-shifts the enable command into the negative domain. R1103 pulls EN_N15\nto N15_RAW when off; R1102/R1104 feed the optocoupler collector from BUS24."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
